### Arquivo .env (backend)
- DATABASE_URL: postgresql+asyncpg://...@localhost:5432/conecta_pro
- REDIS_URL: redis://localhost:6379/1
- JWT_SECRET_KEY: (configurado)
- ENVIRONMENT: production

### Portas
- 8080: Backend API
- 5432: PostgreSQL
- 6379: Redis
- 3002: Grafana
